Public License version 2 only (LICENSE). Source: this repository at the tag of the release, plus third_party/Nintendont
at the pinned commit; the patch series in offline/nintendont-vbba/patches/ marks every change ("altered versions").

Third-party components:
* Nintendont (FIX94 and contributors), https://github.com/FIX94/Nintendont, commit bbc0a208e81d6ab0a828a431dc0b2ba6fc06aec5,
  GPL-2.0: git submodule third_party/Nintendont, patched at build time; it bundles its own third-party code under its own notices.
* libogc (devkitPro) and libfat, linked from the toolchain: zlib-style licences (with the RTEMS notice for libogc's threads).
* offline/bba/bba_mx98728.[ch]: behaviour and constants that follow libogc / libogc2 (gcif.c), zlib licence (LICENSES/Zlib.txt).
* Aileron typeface (Sora Sagano), CC0-1.0: docs/brand/Aileron-Regular.ttf, rendered into the shell's font.
* GTS Root R1-R4 (Google Trust Services) public CA certificates compiled into offline/net/tls/sdroots.c.

No Nintendo or Slippi data is in this repository: the loader reads the player's own Melee disc at run time.
